# Travel summary

The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR [[cite:obs-d93bd5a70e63280cdc87f129beb482ca9f05607d "The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR."]].

Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director [[cite:obs-23368ba6840031cd61e7313c5d05f38607a83d1f "Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director."]].
